# Bun
# bun.lock (Bun's current lockfile) is committed where a package has one
# (e.g. plugins/postgresql/packages/postgres-mcp/bun.lock).
bun.lockb

# Test artifacts
test-results/
playwright-report/

# NOTE: The following are intentional plugin artifacts and must NEVER be ignored:
# - Authoring sources (committed, regenerated by Builder): plugin.yml, skills-src/
# - Generated distribution files (committed, reproducible from the sources):
#   plugin.json, mcp.json, skills/*/SKILL.md
# Users installing a plugin copy only the generated distribution files (+ README.md,
# LICENSE, and postgresql's packages/postgres-mcp/) — never the authoring sources.
# See README.md "For Users: Installing Plugins" / "For Developers: Modifying Plugins".
